        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ andũ ma Isilaeli meeaanisye nguthu ilĩ: nyunzu ya andũ yamũatĩĩa Tivini mwana wa Nginathi, mamũtw’ĩkĩthye mũsumbĩ; na nyunzu yaatĩĩa Omili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ andũ ala mamũatĩĩe Omili mamakĩlya vinya andũ ala mamũatĩĩe Tivini mwana wa Nginathi: kwondũ wa ũu Tivini akw’a, na Omili asumbĩka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa mĩongo ĩtatũ na ũmwe wa kũsumbĩka kwa Asa mũsumbĩ wa Yuta Omili ambĩlĩlya kũsumbĩka Isilaeli, na asumbĩka myaka ĩkũmi na ĩlĩ: asumbĩka myaka thanthatũ Tilisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na athooa kwa Semeli kĩĩma kya Samalia na thooa wa talendi ilĩ sya vetha; na aaka ku kĩĩmanĩ, na eeta syĩtwa ya ndũa ĩla wakie Samalia, kwĩtanĩsya na syĩtwa ya Semeli, mwene wa kĩĩma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omili eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku, na eekaa ũthũku kũvĩtũka onthe ala maĩ mbee wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
